  "construction": "Plain fold of a pair-partition CPM CSS code of arXiv:2609.30069 with J = 3, L = 8, P = 31. Parent qubit q = t*L + b. Parent X row (i,t) meets ((t - E[i][b]) mod P)*L + b for each block b. The involution is pi(t,b) = ((t - B[sigma[b]]) mod P, sigma[b]). Each folded qubit pairs a representative from the instance file's fold_representatives with its partner. Each parent X row becomes one generator, X on representatives and Z on partners. E = [[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [0, 15, 26, 10, 25, 2, 8, 16], [0, 22, 5, 27, 24, 6, 21, 3]], sigma = [6, 4, 7, 5, 1, 3, 0, 2], B = [11, 27, 4, 20, 4, 11, 20, 27].",
